 journey unless you want it to be — a route through the buildings and landscapes that pilgrimage produced, which is most of what Europe built before it built anything else. It ends where it should, on foot, in the rain, in Galicia. Two of these stops are still working monastic communities and one is a sovereign state.","days":15,"budget":"moderate","difficulty":"moderate","transport":["rail","on foot"],"accommodation":"guesthouse","months":["apr","may","sep","oct"],"interests":["sacred","history","architecture","art"],"creator":"Europedoor editorial","pack":["Boots already broken in — this is not the trip to test them","A credencial if you intend to walk the last stage","Blister tape, before you need it","Something to cover shoulders in every church"],"countries":["France","Greece","Italy","Spain","United Kingdom"],"legs":[{"city":"united-kingdom/london-and-the-south-east/canterbury","name":"Canterbury","country":"United Kingdom","url":"/europe/united-kingdom/london-and-the-south-east/canterbury","nights":2,"note":"","lat":51.28,"lon":1.08},{"city":"france/paris-and-ile-de-france/chartres","name":"Chartres","country":"France","url":"/europe/france/paris-and-ile-de-france/chartres","nights":2,"note":"","lat":48.45,"lon":1.49},{"city":"italy/rome-and-lazio/rome","name":"Rome","country":"Italy","url":"/europe/italy/rome-and-lazio/rome","nights":3,"note":"","lat":41.9,"lon":12.5},{"city":"greece/northern-greece/meteora","name":"Meteora (Kalambaka)","country":"Greece","url":"/europe/greece/northern-greece/meteora","nights":3,"note":"","lat":39.71,"lon":21.63},{"city":"spain/green-spain/santiago-de-compostela","name":"Santiago de Compostela","country":"Spain","url":"/europe/spain/green-spain/santiago-de-compostela","nights":4,"note":"","lat":42.88,"lon":-8.54}]},{"slug":"the-hanseatic-arc","name":"The Hanseatic Arc","url":"/journeys/the-hanseatic-arc","strapline":"The medieval trading league, in order","summary":"Between the 13th and 17th centuries a network of merchant towns ran the northern seas, and they all built with the same brick and the same confidence. This route follows them from Flanders to the Gulf of Finland. What the League left behind is a very specific pleasure: gabled warehouses, town halls larger than the towns needed, and a shared idea of what a rich city should look like.","days":16,"budget":"moderate","difficulty":"easy","transport":["rail","ferry"],"accommodation":"hotel","months":["may","jun","jul","aug","sep"],"interests":["history","architecture","coast","food"],"creator":"Europedoor editorial","pack":["A windproof layer; the Baltic is not warm even in July","Comfortable shoes for brick and cobble","A book for the ferry legs"],"countries":["Belgium","Estonia","Germany","Latvia","Netherlands","Poland"],"legs":[{"city":"belgium/flanders/bruges","name":"Bruges","country":"Belgium","url":"/europe/belgium/flanders/bruges","nights":2,"note":"","lat":51.21,"lon":3.22},{"city":"netherlands/randstad/amsterdam","name":"Amsterdam","country":"Netherlands","url":"/europe/netherlands/randstad/amsterdam","nights":3,"note":"","lat":52.37,"lon":4.9},{"city":"germany/north-germany/lubeck","name":"Lübeck","country":"Germany","url":"/europe/germany/north-germany/lubeck","nights":2,"note":"","lat":53.87,"lon":10.69},{"city":"poland/pomerania-and-the-east/gdansk","name":"Gdańsk","country":"Poland","url":"/europe/poland/pomerania-and-the-east/gdansk","nights":3,"note":"","lat":54.35,"lon":18.65},{"city":"latvia/riga-and-around/riga","name":"Riga","country":"Latvia","url":"/europe/latvia/riga-and-around/riga","nights":2,"note":"","lat":56.95,"lon":24.11},{"city":"estonia/tallinn-and-the-north/tallinn","name":"Tallinn","country":"Estonia","url":"/europe/estonia/tallinn-and-the-north/tallinn","nights":3,"note":"","lat":59.44,"lon":24.75}]},{"slug":"the-classical-mediterranean","name":"The Classical Mediterranean","url":"/journeys/the-classical-mediterranean","strapline":"Greek and Roman cities, on both shores","summary":"Three thousa